---
id: T-0000
title: <one line: what is wrong / what is wanted>
type: {{default_type}}                      # {{types_bar}}
severity: P2                   # P0 gates other work / live breakage; P1 wrong or missing output; P2 degraded; P3 hygiene
status: backlog                # {{states_line}}
repos: [{{default_repo}}]               # {{repos_bar}}{{repos_many}}
areas: []                      # files/dirs this touches -- the overlap check greps this
affects: []                    # every copy/surface the problem lives in; each gets a checkbox under Fix
deploy: none                   # {{deploy_kinds_bar}}
owner:                         # ListAgents name of the owning session, or "human"; empty when unclaimed
worktree:                      # {{worktrees}}/tNNNN-<slug>
branch:                        # tNNNN-<slug>; for a ticket listing several repos a map {<repo>: <branch>, ...}
base:                          # trunk sha the branch was cut from / last rebased onto
claimed:
created:
depends_on: []
siblings: []                   # other tickets that are the same bug elsewhere
blocked_on:                    # a T- id, or the human decision needed, verbatim
human:                         # one-line ask for the human, set by `ticket.sh ask` (<VERB> <what> | <command> | <expected> | <if you do nothing>); cleared by `ask T-xxxx ""` or by the next move
closed_by: []                  # trunk shas that closed it (filled at `merged`)
plan:                          # saved plan path (filled at `ready-to-deploy`)
resolution:                    # only for dropped: not-a-bug | duplicate-of T-xxxx | wontfix | superseded-by T-xxxx
---

## Problem
<2-10 lines with file:line evidence. For a user-reported item, quote the user's words verbatim first.>

## Fix
<What will change, and what will NOT (scope line). One checkbox per `affects` entry:>
- [ ] <surface>  (`path:line`)

## Investigation
<Written by the ticket desk before backlog -> ready: cited lines re-checked against current trunk,
scope, duplicates checked, decisions needed. Empty until triaged.>

## Log
<!-- append-only; one line per transition: "- YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM <session>: <old> -> <new>. <evidence>" -->

